    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="Propagates a Gaussian wavepacket incident on a finite rectangular barrier V(x) = V_0 for \lvert x\rvert &lt; \text{width}/2, using the FFT split-operator solver, and compares the numerically transmitted probability to the exact analytic transmission coefficient T(E) (reusing scattering with a negative &quot;depth&quot;, which turns the well into a barrier of the same \lvert V_0\rvert).">

